ancial risk, whereas his action following the officer's advice made him \"more profitable.\" This proves that in modern agriculture, expert consultation and soil health management are not just technical requirements but are essential economic strategies for sustainable income. His success eventually served as a model for moving away from guesswork toward evidence-based farming.</div></div>"
