use it combined technical soil management with commercial crop selection. Mr. Zaman’s increased profitability proves that modern agricultural advice, focusing on intensive care and high-value outputs, is essential for transforming traditional farming into a commercially viable enterprise. The officer’s plan was a perfect balance of scientific practice and economic reality.</div></div>"
